<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4207"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Gigi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Gigi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 15, 2005 - 9:56 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->He will leave a drop, but as Boffa posted, it will take a few days.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
