<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4233"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 16, 2005 - 7:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I am giving it time, Boffa. I was responding to the post above mine.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4233-->
<!--Post: 4254--><!--Time: 1105978967-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4254"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tbear<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tbear<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 17, 2005 - 8:22 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I believe that he is making the drops backwards. first Vicki, then Nancy. Next time we hear from BTK in a drop is going to be Shirley Vian on 3/17/05.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4254-->
<!--Post: 4261--><!--Time: 1105987206-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4261"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jujuree<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jujuree<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 17, 2005 - 10:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->That&#39;s an interesting perspective, Tbear.  I wonder if that is what he&#39;s doing, working backwards? <BR> <BR>It would make sense and the concept is so simple, I&#39;m surprised it hasn&#39;t been mentioned before.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4261-->
<!--Post: 4271--><!--Time: 1105998875-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4271"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Wade<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wade<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 17, 2005 - 1:54 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tbear- <BR>I think he already made his &#39;drop&#39; regarding Shirley....as the post mark date for his letter last year was dated on the anniversary.  I don&#39;t think he is doing anything in order.  He&#39;s just doing it however he wants to. <BR>IMO, the next communication will involve the Otero&#39;s.  That doesn&#39;t mean it will be exactly on the date just passed, or it could have been and it just hasn&#39;t been found or released yet by authorities.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4271-->
<!--Post: 4272--><!--Time: 1106002385-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4272"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tbear<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tbear<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 17, 2005 - 2:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->No disrespect intended, Wade. You are correct on 3/19 a letter was recv&#39;d, however it included info related to Vicki. Maybe he got confused? I disagree that the next &#39;drop&#39; or communique will have to do with the Otero&#39;s. I think that will be his last, and it really would not surprise me if an ederly/ill BTK walked into the police station to deliver this final package himself. Sort of a last opportunity to say, &#34;GOTCHA! and by the time you get around to prosecuting me, I&#39;ll be dead.&#34; Of course, I&#39;m neither an investigator, psycologist, nor a psychic. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4272-->
<!--Post: 4281--><!--Time: 1106021133-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4281"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Wade<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wade<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 17, 2005 - 8:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tbear- <BR>You may be more pyschic than you think! <BR>My other thought, as opposed to dropping otero linked things, was for him to turn himself in with the information just as you have explained in your post! <BR>doo doo doo doo doo.....<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4281-->
<!--Post: 4288--><!--Time: 1106042540-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4288"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 18, 2005 - 2:02 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I predict that BTK will never turn himself in. I&#39;d love to see it, though.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4288-->
<!--Post: 4803--><!--Time: 1106757242-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4803"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vscantu1@msn.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 8:34 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->RESEARCHER: Sorry to see your reason for starting this thread go &#34;up in smoke&#34;. I also would have liked to see BLT leave us forever. But the new &#34;Post Toasties&#34; drop yesterday makes &#34;toast&#34; of that hope!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4803-->
<!--Post: 4807--><!--Time: 1106759373-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4807"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Researcher<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Researcher<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 9:09 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Yes V - I was dead wrong. And am glad I was too. I shall never apply for a mindreading job, or prophetic office.  Ha!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4807-->
<!--Post: 4809--><!--Time: 1106760966-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4809"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stealth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stealth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 9:36 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Don&#39;t feel bad...A lot of us will have to end up being wrong on this deal...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4809-->
<!--Post: 4883--><!--Time: 1106791825-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4883"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 6:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Every good theory rests on the ashes of numerous good, disproven hypotheses and predictions.  I was afraid you were right, but glad we were wrong. <BR> <BR>The core of your hypothesis remains - will he dump all his trophies and go incommunicado at some point, perhaps when only his DNA is left to incriminate him?  Or will he taunt until he drops?  This is still a valid question. <BR> <BR>Even worse - if he somehow managed to wriggle past the DNA evidence &#40;by luck or cunning&#41;, he could return to freedom &#40;barring overwhelming cirsumstantial evidence or a more thorough DNA test&#41; by merely dropping his &#34;precious&#34; trophies, freeing himself of the evidence.  My guess would be that, if so, he would milk them for maximum taunt, much as we see.  Then, you would be correct - no more drops, no more BTK. <BR> <BR>If LE knows that BTK&#39;s bag of goodies is getting small, they had best do a data drop, in my opinion.  Otherwise, he could be gone for good.  He would join the Ripper and Zodiac in legend - presumably his intention all along.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
